</nav>

<header id="top">
  <img class="hero__img" src="assets/hero-real.jpg" alt="Completed residential build by J. Hirst Constructions - brick home at handover with veranda and front fence" width="1200" height="673" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  <div class="hero__scrim" aria-hidden="true"></div>
  <div class="hero__in">
    <p class="hero__kick">RESIDENTIAL BUILDER - NSW</p>
    <h1>New homes, extensions &amp; renovations. <em>Built square, level and true.</em></h1>
    <p class="hero__sub">From set-out and slab to lockup and handover - structural carpentry, project management and quality craftsmanship on every job.</p>
    <div class="hero__cta">
      <a class="btn btn--p" href="#quote">Get a free quote</a>
      <a class="btn btn--o" href="#gallery">See recent work</a>
    </div>
    <ul class="hero__facts">
      <li>New homes</li>
      <li>Extensions &amp; renovations</li>
      <li>Structural carpentry</li>
      <li>Project management</li>
    </ul>
  </div>
</header>

<div data-ux="marquee" class="ux-strip" aria-hidden="true"><div><span>New homes</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Extensions &amp; renovations</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Structural carpentry</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Project management</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>New home - frame to lockup</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Second-storey extension</span><span class="uxdot">·</span><span>Structural renovation</span><span class="uxdot">·</span></div></div>

<section class="sec" id="services" aria-labelledby="s-t">
  <p class="kick">What we do</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="s-t">Carpentry &amp; building, start to finish</h2>
  <p class="lead">Residential construction across new builds, extensions and structural renovations - run by a builder who is on site through every stage.</p>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">01</p><h3 class="svc__h">New homes</h3><p class="svc__p">Ground-up residential construction - set-out, slab, frame, lockup and fit-out through to completion.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">02</p><h3 class="svc__h">Extensions &amp; renovations</h3><p class="svc__p">Room additions, second-storey extensions and whole-house renovations - structural work through to finish.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">03</p><h3 class="svc__h">Structural carpentry</h3><p class="svc__p">Floor systems, wall frames, roof trusses, beams and lintels - precision joinery on site.</p></article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight"><p class="svc__n">04</p><h3 class="svc__h">Project management</h3><p class="svc__p">Scheduling, subcontractor coordination, certifier liaison and quality control through to handover.</p></article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec" id="gallery" aria-labelledby="g-t">
  <p class="kick">Recent work</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="g-t">Projects on site</h2>
  <div class="svc">
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight">
      <img class="svc__img" src="assets/hero-work.jpg" alt="Residential build under construction - frame and roof works in progress" loading="lazy" width="810" height="1080">
      <p class="svc__n">01</p>
      <h3 class="svc__h">New home - frame to lockup</h3>
      <p class="svc__p">Structural timber frame, roof trusses and external cladding - built square, level and true.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight">
      <img class="svc__img" src="assets/gal_2.jpg" alt="Second-storey extension structural works on an existing home" loading="lazy" width="1080" height="922">
      <p class="svc__n">02</p>
      <h3 class="svc__h">Second-storey extension</h3>
      <p class="svc__p">Structural floor system, wall frames and roof - integrated with the existing dwelling.</p>
    </article>
    <article class="svc__it rv" data-ux="spotlight">
      <img class="svc__img" src="assets/gal_3.jpg" alt="Structural renovation carpentry - new framing and load-bearing works" loading="lazy" width="810" height="1080">
      <p class="svc__n">03</p>
      <h3 class="svc__h">Structural renovation</h3>
      <p class="svc__p">Beams, lintels, floor systems and load-bearing walls - precision joinery on site.</p>
    </article>
  </div>
</section>

<section class="sec sec--panel" id="process" aria-labelledby="p-t">
  <div class="inner">
  <p class="kick">How we build</p>
  <h2 class="h2" id="p-t">Five stages from set-out to handover</h2>
  <div class="steps">
    <article class="step rv"><span class="step-n">01</span><h3>Set-out &amp; slab</h3><p>Profiles set, levels checked, termite treatment, reinforcement placed and slab poured to the engineer's spec.</p></article>
    <article class="step rv"><span class="step-n">02</span><h3>Frame</h3><p>Floor system, wall frames and roof trusses erected plumb and straight - all connections fixed to code.</p></article>
    <article class="step rv"><span class="step-n">03</span><h3>Lockup</h3><p>Roof on, windows and external doors fitted, cladding fixed, building wrapped - weather tight.</p></article>
    <article class="step rv"><span class="step-n">04</span><h3>Fit-out</h3><p>Internal linings, joinery, wet areas waterproofed and tiled, services rough-in completed.</p></article>
    <article class="step rv"><span class="step-n">05</span><h3>Completion</h3><p>Final fix, paint, hardware, certifier inspection, defects cleared and keys handed over.</p></article>
  </div>
  </div>
</section>

<footer class="foot">
  <div>
    <a class="nav__b" href="#top" aria-label="J. Hirst Constructions - home">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 48 48" width="32" height="32" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7 35h34" stroke="#c9762e" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" fill="none"/><path d="M8 35.5 24 15l16 20.5" stroke="#c9762e" stroke-width="3.2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" fill="none"/><rect x="17" y="22.5" width="14" height="13" rx="1.5" fill="none" stroke="#e8a85e" stroke-width="2.2"/></svg>
      <span>J. Hirst Constructions</span>
    </a>
    <p>Residential builder - new homes, extensions &amp; renovations, structural carpentry and project management.</p>
    <p class="abn">ABN 54 502 769 530</p>
